      "content": "those are a good start, but a bit generic. i want to ground them more in the specific demographics of the city. for the street-level crime stuff, can you give me some more detailed profiles? like, if i'm looking at the different ethnic neighborhoods or the groups that hang out on the corner, how would those characters look or act? give me a few specific descriptions for guys involved in the local drug trade or petty crime, maybe broken down by their background so i can make the social divide in the city feel real.",
